 : HKD 200\,000 covering all expenses (travel\, living\, insurance and rese
 arch costs). No application fee mentioned.\nDuration: 3 to 6 months attach
 ed to M+ in Hong Kong.\n\nMore: https://www.mplus.org.hk/en/awards-and-fel
 lowships/sigg-fellowship-for-chinese-art-research/?utm_source=artificialno
