  doctoral students in electrical engineering and computer science\, mathem
 atics\, physics or statistics\; research does not need to relate to tradin
 g.\n\nOrganisation: Jane Street\nLocation: For full-time PhD students at a
 ccredited research institutions in the US\, Canada\, UK\, Europe\, Austral
 ia\, New Zealand or Singapore. International students welcome.\nAward: Ful
 l tuition and fees for the award year plus a USD 50\,000 stipend (or local
 -currency equivalent\; taxable). Finalists receive USD 5\,000. No applicat
 ion fee.\nDuration: One academic year.\n\nMore: https://www.janestreet.com
 /join-jane-street/programs-and-events/graduate-research-fellowship/?utm_so
 urce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
